Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 12:18:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] feat(ai): add the command bar and the AI settings and
 journal dialog

Floating command bar docked over the document: instruction, scope
(selection or whole document), plan and steps, Accept / Discard, note
for changes Word cannot track. Settings and journal dialog with
connection test and JSON export. Plain DOM with injected styles and the
editor's theme variables; icons from Fluent UI System Icons (MIT).

[ai]

Assisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
